      "arabic": "١٢٢٤٧- أمّ مبشّر:\nالأنصارية أخرى «٢»، وهي زوج البراء بن معرور، والد التي قبلها، وهي والدة مبشر بن البراء المذكور.\n(١) أخرجه البيهقي في السنن ٦/ ١٣٨.\n(٢) أسد الغابة ت (٧٥٩١) .",
      "english": "12247—Umm Mubashshir:\n\nAnother Ansari woman. (2) She was the wife of al-Bara ibn Ma'rur, the father of the preceding woman, and the mother of the aforementioned Mubashshir ibn al-Bara.\n\n(1) Al-Bayhaqi transmitted it in al-Sunan, 6/138.\n\n(2) Usd al-Ghaba, entry (7591).",
      "arabic_sha256": "c971e41fa7b12ece32d280375d37a72951c00f18202808feb6fbb604328fdff0",
      "english_sha256": "f54005caf3efbc15e8cc885f25db68721d6c4ca29a2255da9e1bf677edeb8305",
      "machine_state": "machine_validated_unreviewed"
    },
    {
      "id": "isabah-entry-00012247-segment-0002",
      "volume": 8,
      "scan_page": 473,
      "printed_page": 472,
      "reader_page": 4385,
      "reader_url": "https://usul.ai/t/isaba-fi-tamyiz/4385",
      "source_unit_id": "ibn_hajar_isabah_v1:arabic:v08:p0473:b9f6c84fc251ec4d",
      "arabic": "قال الحميديّ في مسندة: حدثنا سفيان، حدثنا عمرو بن دينار، عن الزهري، عن ابن كعب بن مالك، عن أبيه- أنه حضرته الوفاة فقالت له أم مبشر: أقرئ مني السلام، فقال:\nهكذا قال رسول اللَّه ﵌: «نسمة المؤمن في طير خضر تأكل من ثمر الجنّة» «١» .\nوكانت قبله أو بعده عند زيد بن حارثة، وقد روت أيضا.",
      "english": "Al-Humaydi said in his Musnad: Sufyan narrated to us; Amr ibn Dinar narrated to us, from al-Zuhri, from a son of Ka'b ibn Malik, from his father: when death came to him, Umm Mubashshir said to him, “Convey greetings from me.” He said: This is what the Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, said: “The soul of the believer is in green birds that eat of the fruit of Paradise.”¹\n\nShe was married to Zayd ibn Haritha either before or after al-Bara ibn Ma'rur, and she also transmitted reports.",
      "arabic_sha256": "d2dbcb97f63e702df95c1e99e220d9b13a24300cfe7baacb5808d703b801e00d",
      "english_sha256": "2760499b81d7c92e8fb51b53513595f009bd851c32faa9232365a940a058a7d2",
      "machine_state": "machine_validated_unreviewed"
    }
